  'pxs.step1': 'Step 1: prepare Proxmox (once)',
  'pxs.why': 'WhatsOnMyNet gets a user of its own that may only read, and a key for it (API token). Nothing is installed on Proxmox.',
  'pxs.tabCmd': 'With commands (recommended)', 'pxs.tabGui': 'By clicking',
  'pxs.pve.cmd1': 'In Proxmox click a node on the left and open `>_ Shell` at the top. One node is enough - in a cluster it applies to all.',
  'pxs.pbs.cmd1': 'In the Backup Server open `Administration` → `Shell` on the left.',
  'pxs.cmd2': 'Copy all lines with "Copy", paste them into the shell and press Enter:',
  'pxs.pve.cmd3': 'The output shows a table. The row `value` holds the secret (a long string with dashes). Copy it - it is shown only this once - and paste it below into "Token secret".',
  'pxs.pbs.cmd3': 'After the third command `"value"` holds the secret (a long string with dashes). Copy it - it is shown only this once - and paste it below into "Token secret".',
  'pxs.pve.gui1': '`Datacenter → Permissions → Users` → `Add`: user name `whatsonmynet`, realm `Proxmox VE authentication server`, any password → `Add`.',
  'pxs.pve.gui2': '`Datacenter → Permissions` → `Add` → `User Permission`: path `/`, user `whatsonmynet@pve`, role `PVEAuditor` → `Add`.',
  'pxs.pve.gui3': '`Datacenter → Permissions → API Tokens` → `Add`: user `whatsonmynet@pve`, token ID only `womn` (no @ or !), **untick** `Privilege Separation` → `Add`.',
  'pxs.pve.gui4': 'Proxmox now shows the `Secret` - only this once. Copy it and paste it below into "Token secret".',
  'pxs.pbs.gui1': '`Configuration → Access Control → User Management` → `Add`: user name `whatsonmynet`, realm `Proxmox Backup authentication server`, any password.',
  'pxs.pbs.gui2': 'Tab `API Token` → `Add`: user `whatsonmynet@pbs`, token name `womn`. Copy the `Secret` shown (only this once) and paste it below into "Token secret".',
  'pxs.pbs.gui3': 'Tab `Permissions` → `Add` → `User Permission`: path `/`, user `whatsonmynet@pbs`, role `Audit`.',
  'pxs.pbs.gui4': 'Once more `Add` → `API Token Permission`: path `/`, token `whatsonmynet@pbs!womn`, role `Audit`.',
